      ],
      "Text": "To request access, visit Verified on LinkedIn and submit an access request.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Configure Redirect URI",
      "Anchor": "configure-redirect-uri",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Set Up OAuth (2 minutes)",
        "Configure Redirect URI"
      ],
      "Text": "Go to Developer Portal \u2192 Your App \u2192 Auth tab\nAdd your redirect URI (e.g., https://yourapp.com/auth/linkedin/callback)\nNote your Client ID and Client Secret",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Request Authorization",
      "Anchor": "request-authorization",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Set Up OAuth (2 minutes)",
        "Request Authorization"
      ],
      "Text": "Redirect the member to LinkedIn\u0027s authorization page with all required scopes:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Request Authorization",
      "Anchor": "request-authorization",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Set Up OAuth (2 minutes)",
        "Request Authorization"
      ],
      "Text": "GET https://www.linkedin.com/oauth/v2/authorization\n  ?response_type=code\n  \u0026client_id={YOUR_CLIENT_ID}\n  \u0026redirect_uri={YOUR_REDIRECT_URI}\n  \u0026state={RANDOM_STRING}\n  \u0026scope=r_verify_details%20r_profile_basicinfo%20r_primary_current_experience%20r_most_recent_education",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Request Authorization",
      "Anchor": "request-authorization",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Set Up OAuth (2 minutes)",
        "Request Authorization"
      ],
      "Text": "Required OAuth Scopes (Plus Tier):",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Request Authorization",
      "Anchor": "request-authorization",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Set Up OAuth (2 minutes)",
        "Request Authorization"
      ],
      "Text": "r_verify_details \u2013 Detailed verification metadata\nr_profile_basicinfo \u2013 Basic profile info\nr_primary_current_experience \u2013 Current job details\nr_most_recent_education \u2013 Education information",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Request Authorization",
      "Anchor": "request-authorization",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Set Up OAuth (2 minutes)",
        "Request Authorization"
      ],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Request Authorization",
      "Anchor": "request-authorization",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Set Up OAuth (2 minutes)",
        "Request Authorization"
      ],
      "Text": "Request all scopes at once for the best user experience. See Implementation Guide for details.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Request Authorization",
      "Anchor": "request-authorization",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Set Up OAuth (2 minutes)",
        "Request Authorization"
      ],
      "Text": "The state parameter is a standard OAuth 2.0 parameter used to pass per-request session data, such as CSRF tokens, session identifiers, or routing context.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Request Authorization",
      "Anchor": "request-authorization",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Set Up OAuth (2 minutes)",
        "Request Authorization"
      ],
      "Text": "Example:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Request Authorization",
      "Anchor": "request-authorization",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Set Up OAuth (2 minutes)",
        "Request Authorization"
      ],
      "Text": "https://example.com/callback?state=abc123",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Request Authorization",
      "Anchor": "request-authorization",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Set Up OAuth (2 minutes)",
        "Request Authorization"
      ],
      "Text": "When used with Verified on LinkedIn verification flows, the state parameter is preserved and passed through to your registered redirectUri after verification completes.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Request Authorization",
      "Anchor": "request-authorization",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Set Up OAuth (2 minutes)",
        "Request Authorization"
      ],
      "Text": "For more information about redirect URI validation and state parameter behavior, see Verification URL.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Exchange Code for Access Token",
      "Anchor": "exchange-code-for-access-token",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Set Up OAuth (2 minutes)",
        "Exchange Code for Access Token"
      ],
      "Text": "After the member approves, LinkedIn redirects to your URI with an authorization code. Exchange it for an access token:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Exchange Code for Access Token",
      "Anchor": "exchange-code-for-access-token",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Set Up OAuth (2 minutes)",
        "Exchange Code for Access Token"
      ],
      "Text": "curl -X POST \u0027https://www.linkedin.com/oauth/v2/accessToken\u0027 \\\n  -H \u0027Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\u0027 \\\n  -d \u0027grant_type=authorization_code\u0027 \\\n  -d \u0027code={AUTHORIZATION_CODE}\u0027 \\\n  -d \u0027redirect_uri={YOUR_REDIRECT_URI}\u0027 \\\n  -d \u0027client_id={YOUR_CLIENT_ID}\u0027 \\\n  -d \u0027client_secret={YOUR_CLIENT_SECRET}\u0027",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Exchange Code for Access Token",
      "Anchor": "exchange-code-for-access-token",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Set Up OAuth (2 minutes)",
        "Exchange Code for Access Token"
      ],
      "Text": "Sample Response:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Exchange Code for Access Token",
      "Anchor": "exchange-code-for-access-token",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Set Up OAuth (2 minutes)",
        "Exchange Code for Access Token"
      ],
      "Text": "{\n  \u0022access_token\u0022: \u0022AQWsGriMiJuFpzv7...\u0022,\n  \u0022expires_in\u0022: 5183999,\n  \u0022refresh_token\u0022: \u0022AQVObXp9RNF9RuuN...\u0022,\n  \u0022scope\u0022: \u0022r_verify_details,r_profile_basicinfo,r_primary_current_experience,r_most_recent_education\u0022,\n  \u0022token_type\u0022: \u0022Bearer\u0022\n}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Exchange Code for Access Token",
      "Anchor": "exchange-code-for-access-token",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Set Up OAuth (2 minutes)",
        "Exchange Code for Access Token"
      ],
      "Text": "Important",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Exchange Code for Access Token",
      "Anchor": "exchange-code-for-access-token",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Set Up OAuth (2 minutes)",
        "Exchange Code for Access Token"
      ],
      "Text": "Access tokens expire in 60 days\nRefresh tokens expire in 365 days\nStore both tokens securely and implement automatic refresh",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
