      "Text": "{\n  \u0022id\u0022: \u0022abc123\u0022,\n  \u0022verifications\u0022: [\u0022IDENTITY\u0022, \u0022WORKPLACE\u0022],\n  \u0022identityVerification\u0022: {\n    \u0022verifiedName\u0022: {\n      \u0022firstName\u0022: {\n        \u0022localized\u0022: { \u0022en_US\u0022: \u0022John\u0022 },\n        \u0022preferredLocale\u0022: { \u0022country\u0022: \u0022US\u0022, \u0022language\u0022: \u0022en\u0022 }\n      },\n      \u0022lastName\u0022: {\n        \u0022localized\u0022: { \u0022en_US\u0022: \u0022Doe\u0022 },\n        \u0022preferredLocale\u0022: { \u0022country\u0022: \u0022US\u0022, \u0022language\u0022: \u0022en\u0022 }\n      }\n    },\n    \u0022verifiedAt\u0022: 1698796800000\n  },\n  \u0022workplaceVerification\u0022: {\n    \u0022organizationName\u0022: \u0022Contoso\u0022,\n    \u0022organizationLogoUrl\u0022: \u0022https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/...\u0022,\n    \u0022verificationMethod\u0022: \u0022WORK_EMAIL\u0022,\n    \u0022verifiedAt\u0022: 1698796800000\n  }\n}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 3: Call /verificationReport API (3 minutes)",
      "Anchor": "step-3-call-verificationreport-api-3-minutes",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 3: Call /verificationReport API (3 minutes)"
      ],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 3: Call /verificationReport API (3 minutes)",
      "Anchor": "step-3-call-verificationreport-api-3-minutes",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 3: Call /verificationReport API (3 minutes)"
      ],
      "Text": "Plus tier returns detailed metadata including verified names, timestamps, and verification methods. Development/Lite tiers only return verification categories.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 3: Call /verificationReport API (3 minutes)",
      "Anchor": "step-3-call-verificationreport-api-3-minutes",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 3: Call /verificationReport API (3 minutes)"
      ],
      "Text": "The /verificationReport API also supports the optional verifiedWithinDays query parameter for enterprise workflows that require periodic re-verification.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 3: Call /verificationReport API (3 minutes)",
      "Anchor": "step-3-call-verificationreport-api-3-minutes",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 3: Call /verificationReport API (3 minutes)"
      ],
      "Text": "Example:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Step 3: Call /verificationReport API (3 minutes)",
      "Anchor": "step-3-call-verificationreport-api-3-minutes",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 3: Call /verificationReport API (3 minutes)"
      ],
      "Text": "GET /verificationReport?verifiedWithinDays=30",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 3: Call /verificationReport API (3 minutes)",
      "Anchor": "step-3-call-verificationreport-api-3-minutes",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 3: Call /verificationReport API (3 minutes)"
      ],
      "Text": "If an existing verification is older than 30 days, the response includes a verificationUrl so the member can re-verify while existing verification data continues to be returned.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 3: Call /verificationReport API (3 minutes)",
      "Anchor": "step-3-call-verificationreport-api-3-minutes",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 3: Call /verificationReport API (3 minutes)"
      ],
      "Text": "See the Verification Report API for complete details.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 4: Call /validationStatus API (3 minutes)",
      "Anchor": "step-4-call-validationstatus-api-3-minutes",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 4: Call /validationStatus API (3 minutes)"
      ],
      "Text": "Check data freshness for multiple members in bulk (Plus tier exclusive):",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Step 4: Call /validationStatus API (3 minutes)",
      "Anchor": "step-4-call-validationstatus-api-3-minutes",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 4: Call /validationStatus API (3 minutes)"
      ],
      "Text": "curl -X POST \u0027https://api.linkedin.com/rest/validationStatus\u0027 \\\n  -H \u0027Authorization: Bearer {ACCESS_TOKEN}\u0027 \\\n  -H \u0027LinkedIn-Version: {LATEST_VERSION}\u0027 \\\n  -H \u0027Content-Type: application/json\u0027 \\\n  -d \u0027{\n    \u0022memberIds\u0022: [\u0022abc123\u0022, \u0022def456\u0022, \u0022ghi789\u0022]\n  }\u0027",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 4: Call /validationStatus API (3 minutes)",
      "Anchor": "step-4-call-validationstatus-api-3-minutes",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 4: Call /validationStatus API (3 minutes)"
      ],
      "Text": "Sample Response:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Step 4: Call /validationStatus API (3 minutes)",
      "Anchor": "step-4-call-validationstatus-api-3-minutes",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 4: Call /validationStatus API (3 minutes)"
      ],
      "Text": "{\n  \u0022results\u0022: [\n    {\n      \u0022memberId\u0022: \u0022abc123\u0022,\n      \u0022status\u0022: \u0022FRESH\u0022,\n      \u0022lastRefreshedAt\u0022: 1760631246905\n    },\n    {\n      \u0022memberId\u0022: \u0022def456\u0022,\n      \u0022status\u0022: \u0022STALE\u0022,\n      \u0022lastRefreshedAt\u0022: 1698796800000\n    },\n    {\n      \u0022memberId\u0022: \u0022ghi789\u0022,\n      \u0022status\u0022: \u0022FRESH\u0022,\n      \u0022lastRefreshedAt\u0022: 1760500000000\n    }\n  ]\n}",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 4: Call /validationStatus API (3 minutes)",
      "Anchor": "step-4-call-validationstatus-api-3-minutes",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 4: Call /validationStatus API (3 minutes)"
      ],
      "Text": "Important",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 4: Call /validationStatus API (3 minutes)",
      "Anchor": "step-4-call-validationstatus-api-3-minutes",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 4: Call /validationStatus API (3 minutes)"
      ],
      "Text": "2-legged OAuth - Uses client credentials (no member consent required)\nBatch limit - Up to 500 member IDs per request\nUse case - Check if cached data needs refreshing",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
