      "Text": "\u2705 Use /validationStatus to check if data is stale\n\u2705 Refresh stale data proactively\n\u2705 Cache API responses appropriately\n\u2705 See Data Freshness Guide\n\u2705 Use verifiedWithinDays on /verificationReport when members must periodically re-confirm their identity or workplace verification during interactive user flows.",
